<title>POLAND: PROCHNIK FALLS ON JANUARY NET LOSS.</title>
<headline>PROCHNIK FALLS ON JANUARY NET LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish garment maker Prochnik SA tumbled 9.5 percent to 8.6 zlotys after showing a January net loss of 0.7 million zlotys on Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>Last year the firm lost 0.2 million zlotys in January.</p>
<p>&quot;Today's session was one of those when investors want to punish companies for their poor earnings and Prochnik was one of the stocks punished,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Analysts were not sure whether the stock would rebound or keep falling in the next few sessions.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
